<BaseLayout title="About Toolwise AI" description="Why Toolwise AI publishes practical AI workflows and clear decision guides."><article class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">About us</span><h1>Less noise. Better work.</h1><p>Toolwise AI is an independent editorial project for freelancers, solo entrepreneurs and small teams who want to use AI with more clarity and less hype.</p><h2>What we publish</h2><p>Practical workflows, decision frameworks, explainers and comparisons that help readers evaluate tools in the context of real work. We aim to explain trade-offs, limitations and questions worth checking—not promise effortless results.</p><h2>How we approach evidence</h2><p>We distinguish general workflow guidance from product-specific claims. Features, pricing, terms and availability can change, so readers should verify current details with the relevant provider. We do not claim hands-on testing unless a specific article clearly describes a test that was actually performed.</p><h2>Who is responsible?</h2><p>Toolwise AI is run by an independent editorial team. Questions, corrections and feedback are welcome through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
